Package: levyfit
Title: Maximum Likelihood Estimation for Levy Degradation Processes
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Amedée Rytrace", "Tito", , "rytracetito5@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Maximum likelihood estimation of the parameters of
    degradation models based on Levy and related processes (Wiener, gamma,
    inverse Gaussian, variance-gamma, Meixner and inverse gamma processes)
    from one or several trajectories observed at possibly irregular
    inspection times, and generation of inspection schedules.
